[0.473, "o", "\r\nAdd 12 observer hooks and enable codex-scope.service at startup.\r\nEndpoint: http://127.0.0.1:4319. Capture is discarded whenever no viewer is connected.\r\nApply these changes and run the two interactive tests? [y/N]: "]
