[1.064, "o", "CODEX_HOME=/tmp/scope-setup-test-gpzwveqb/.codex codex -C /tmp/scope-setup-test-gpzwveqb\r\nOpen /hooks, approve only the 12 new codex-scope commands, then exit.\r\nIf another MCP blocks startup, fix it separately; setup will not disable it.\r\nHave you approved those hooks? [y/N]: "]
[1.115, "o", "y\r\n"]
